<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n32191" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔκ-κλῐσις</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εως</span>,
			ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>turning out of one's course, deflexion,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῆς σελήνης</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					2.929c
				</span></i>
			 (pl.). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>tendency,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Pr.</u>
				863b24
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>dislocation,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Art.</u>
				62
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			<i>avoidance, refusal,</i> opp.<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αἵρεσις,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Cleanth.Stoic.
				1.129
			</span></i>(pl.) ; opp.<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐκλογή,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				<u>Stoic.</u>
				3.190
			</span></i> ; opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὄρεξις,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Epict.
				<u>Ench.</u>
				2
			</span></i> ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῶν ὀχληρῶν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.E.
					<u>M.</u>
					1.51
				</span></i>
			 ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῆς βλάβης</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Gal.
					13.124
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Plot.
				1.4.6
			</span></i>, etc. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>IV.</b>
			<i>moral declension,</i> ib.<i><span class="en">
				8.15
			</span></i>.</div>
